  "content": "<div class=\"p-8 font-sans max-w-md mx-auto bg-sky-50/40 text-blue-950 rounded-3xl border-2 border-sky-200/60 relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg\">\n  <div class=\"absolute -top-10 -right-10 text-6xl opacity-10\">🎈</div>\n  <div class=\"absolute -bottom-10 -left-10 text-6xl opacity-10\">🎈</div>\n  \n  <div class=\"text-center relative z-10 space-y-4\">\n    <div class=\"text-5xl\">🐘👶🌧️</div>\n    <p class=\"text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-sky-600 uppercase font-bold\">Chá de Bebê do</p>\n    <h1 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-sky-800 tracking-tight\">{{nome_bebe}}</h1>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-sky-900 leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto\">\n      Estou quase chegando! Mamãe e papai gostariam de se reunir com pessoas amadas para celebrar a minha vinda!\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"my-6 border-y border-sky-200 py-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-center\">\n      <div class=\"bg-white/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-sky-100\">\n        <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-sky-500 uppercase\">Quando</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-sm text-sky-900 font-bold\">{{data_cha}}</strong>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-white/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-sky-100\">\n        <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-sky-500 uppercase\">Horário</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-sm text-sky-900 font-bold\">{{hora_cha}}hs</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-sky-100/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-sky-200 text-center\">\n      <span class=\"block text-[9px] font-mono text-sky-600 uppercase mb-1\">Onde será</span>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-sky-900 font-medium\">{{local_cha}}</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-white/90 p-3 rounded-xl border border-sky-200/50 text-center text-xs\">\n      <span class=\"block text-[9px] font-mono text-sky-600 uppercase\">Sugestão de Fralda para Você 🎁</span>\n      <strong class=\"text-sky-800\">{{sugestao_fralda}}</strong>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n      <p class=\"text-[10px] text-sky-400 font-mono uppercase\">Avise a mamãe se virá no WhatsApp</p>\n      <span class=\"inline-block bg-sky-500 hover:bg-sky-600 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider py-2 px-5 rounded-full shadow-md transition cursor-pointer\">\n        Confirmar: {{contato_cha}}\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
